  "name": "venomancer-mount-cancels-beetle-and-spider-6281",
  "contract": [
    "Beetle and Spider forms carry the native mount interrupt flag. Each form is learned and cast normally. The",
    "authored Brown Horse cast is forbidden while shapeshifted (native result 68), so the fixture applies its",
    "mounted aura to isolate the actual native Unit::Mount event. That mounted event must remove the active",
    "Venomancer form. Native dismount separates the two cases. This covers server mount cancellation; client",
    "automatic unshifting before a mount cast is outside the fixture. The normal server display must return, and",
    "Beetle armor/health and threat helpers must also be gone."
  ],
